# Pre-push CI

Before every `git push`, run the same commands as `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (job **Lint, types, tests, build**), in order:

`pnpm lint` → `pnpm format:check` → `pnpm typecheck` → `pnpm test` → `pnpm build` → `pnpm build-storybook`

If `format:check` fails: `pnpm format`, commit the result, re-check, then push. Do not `--no-verify`.

Known failure: [PR #80 CI](https://github.com/dudaloglobal/d-ui/actions/runs/32976631529/job/98202841713?pr=80) — `prettier --check .` on `docs-locale.ts` and `TimeAgo.stories.tsx`.
